  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Cluster: Hortipreneuria Centre of Excellence South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The impact cluster Hortipreneurial Centre of Excellence South Africa is an initiative of a consortium of Dutch and South African companies &amp; knowledge institutes, in close cooperation with the Netherlands embassy in Pretoria. The Centre of Excellence will be a vehicle to showcase new technologies and empower the South African horticultural value chain. A comprehensive package of training, courses, mentor groups and field activities, with a strong demonstration and knowledge transfer component, will be executed by the consortium members and their external partners. Secondly, the impact cluster programme will focus on creating a market in South Africa for profitable, productive, sustainable and climate smart farming, mainly in greenhouses. The consortium aims to provide knowledge, create awareness and skills for commercial and emerging farmers and new farmers i.e. students.</narrative>
  </description>
